{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Go inside a 4 story mech and fight for ideals you dont understand! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991360/extras/test.png?t=1745047883\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">go into the world beyond the apocalypse, and become a Synthetic! a new creation that blurs the line between machine and nature! these Synthetics pilot Warhammers. giving them immense power over the battlefield. <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991360/extras/QRCodeMech1.png?t=1745047883\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But theres notions of a ghost haunting the most powerful warhammers. taking the strange power inside the machine and pilot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991360/extras/CorpseHammer.gif?t=1745047883\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this Vr mech bullethell, you can customize your mech. replace your arms, legs, chest, head or boosters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991360/extras/ship.png?t=1745047883\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">you can attach smoke grenades to your arm, missle-launchers on your knees, you can even have a gun for a head! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">conquer the battle-field as a truly full armored mech! impossible arsenals are now found possible with the infinite customization of your own cockpit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">wait... if you have all this weaponry attached, wheres the ammo gonna go?<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991360/extras/raisedeyebrowgif.gif?t=1745047883\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">use your 